<p>US military forces boarded the Panamanian-flagged oil tanker Veronica III in the Indian Ocean after tracking it from the Caribbean, the Pentagon said Sunday. US officials say the ship is sanctioned and tied to efforts to move Venezuelan-linked oil in ways that evade restrictions. Several reports connect the boarding to President Donald Trump’s December order to tighten enforcement against sanctioned Venezuela-linked oil shipments at sea.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/7cFGTL2osnuveuPJwL1kESx3XzRv7w_e9AsquPOvIOG3IkoJOFUyIlU6sOAavb0oje_DaZCLi6rrBHnjB-qXlXDrzY9mWGW5ROzfSf8b-MeGqnLUhccPXv1SHI3Gv0xjK_ydG3cZakgWDoXqQ7qGP4RE_umEIU0dKEXF40Kxno8urIpCvqBRmZaAOQ' alt='Image accompanying reports of the US boarding of the tanker Veronica III in the Indian Ocean.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>How it was announced: The Defense Department posted about the boarding on X.</li><li>Flag and status: Reports describe Veronica III as Panamanian-flagged and under US sanctions.</li><li>Timing in Venezuela: The Guardian and Al Jazeera said the tanker left Venezuela the same day Nicolás Maduro was captured during a US operation in January.</li><li>Recent precedent: The Pentagon said it intercepted the tanker Aquila II in a similar operation about a week earlier.</li><li>Stated target: US officials said the broader goal is to go after “illicit oil connected to Venezuela”.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>US Department of Defense: The Defense Department said US forces interdicted and boarded the Veronica III in the Indian Ocean. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-says-it-interdicted-and-boarded-vessel-defying-trumps-quarantine/article70635410.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>BBC (US rationale as reported): US officials accused the Veronica III of violating a “quarantine” on oil shipments from Venezuela. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4ge763d7j6o'>BBC</a>)</li><li>Al Jazeera (ship context as reported): Al Jazeera said Veronica III left Venezuela in January on the same day US forces captured President Nicolás Maduro. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/16/us-forces-board-tanker-in-indian-ocean-that-fled-blockade-on-venezuela'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>The Guardian (sanctions-evasion framing): The Guardian said Venezuela is using a “shadow fleet” of falsely flagged tankers to move crude into global supply chains despite oil sanctions. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/15/us-forces-board-second-venezuelalinked-oil-tanker-in-indian-ocean'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/us-military-boards-sanctioned-oil-tanker-veronica-iii-in-indian-ocean-11007913#publisher=newsstand'>US Military Boards Sanctioned Oil Tanker &#x27;Veronica III&#x27; In Indian Ocean</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-says-it-interdicted-and-boarded-vessel-defying-trumps-quarantine/article70635410.ece'>U.S. military boards another oil tanker in Indian Ocean after tracking it from Caribbean</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/15/us-forces-board-second-venezuelalinked-oil-tanker-in-indian-ocean'>US boards second oil tanker in Indian Ocean after it fled Venezuelan raid</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/USA/Military/2026/0215/military-venezuela-oil-tanker-ocean'>US military boards another oil tanker in Indian Ocean, tracked from Caribbean</a> - csmonitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/us-forces-board-ship-in-indian-ocean-that-fled-caribbean-blockade-pentagon'>US forces board second sanctioned oil tanker in Indian Ocean</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3343657/us-military-boards-another-oil-tanker-indian-ocean-after-tracking-it-caribbean'>US forces board another tanker in Indian Ocean after tracking it from Caribbean</a> - scmp.com</li><